    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6692" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνακεράννῡμι</span></b>  and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνακαχλ-ύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>mix up</i> or <i>again,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνὰ κρητῆρα κέρασσεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					3.390
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶνον ἀνεκεράννυ γλυκύτατον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ra.</u>
					511
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν πόλιν αὐτὴν πρὸς αὑτὴν ἀ. ταῖς
					οἰκειότησιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Cat.Mi.</u>
					25
				</span></i>
			; 
