				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					1.60
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλῷ τῷ θνητῷ ἀνακεραννυμένη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Criti.</u>
					121a
				</span></i>
			: aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κεράσθην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ti.</u>
					87a
				</span></i>
			, part.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κρᾱθείς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Rom.</u>
					29
				</span></i>
			.</div>
